    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk milk and instant pudding mix together in a large serving bowl until thickened, about 2 minutes. Fold in whipped topping until incorporated.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3HRZDRRoW3bcNH9gxE3xX0PPN0o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/234484-oreo-fluff-salad-VAT-006-step-02-7f32fcf7977247bbba1bfcacb5dd72c4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/234484/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir crushed cookies into pudding until well blended. Cover the bowl with plastic wrap; refrigerate until chilled and thickened, at least 1 hour to overnight.",
